%% Phase3 / schedule / G-08 创建定时消息
%% Helix owners: ws/handlers/post_schedule_created.rs; channel/write/schedule.rs; port_reply/message_v3_schedule.rs; event/schedule.rs
%% INV-09: Helix does not run a local delivery timer; Go owns due-time delivery.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as PC Angular UI
  participant Gate as messageV3ImGate
  participant Native as Tauri/Native
  participant FFI as Mobile FFI
  participant Web as Browser/Web
  participant E as ExecutionShell/Tick
  participant IM as helix-im
  participant Host as driver-host
  participant DB as tenant SQLite
  participant Go as Go IM server
  participant WS as WS inbound
  participant Sink as EventSink/adapter

  alt PC Tauri 入口
    UI->>Gate: createSchedule(channelId,text,schedulePostAt,type,props)
    Gate->>Native: invokeAccepted("im_create_schedule", {message,...})
    Native->>E: Tick::Command(AppCommand)
  else Mobile FFI 入口
    FFI->>E: helix_command("im_create_schedule", payload)
  else Web 入口
    Web->>E: invoke("im_create_schedule", payload)
  end
  E->>IM: step(Tick::Command)
  IM->>IM: 校验 owner、channel、schedulePostAt、私有 scope
  IM->>Host: Effect::Http POST create schedule
  Host->>Go: HTTP schedule create
  Go-->>Host: 2xx admission（不让 observer 看见）
  Go-->>WS: WS post_schedule_created(schedule,event_seq)
  WS->>E: Tick::Inbound(post_schedule_created)
  E->>IM: dispatch schedule authority
  IM->>Host: Effect::PersistAtomic(schedule row + channel cursor)
  Host->>DB: 仅 creator tenant 写入 scheduled state
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(PersistOk/PersistErr)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply
  alt creator PersistOk
    IM->>Host: Persist ScopedGet schedule/channel
    Host->>DB: readback creator-only schedule
    DB-->>Host: PortReply(readback)
    Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(readback)
    IM->>Sink: Emit im:channel:schedule-created(creator view)
    Sink-->>UI: Angular shows scheduled message
    Sink-->>FFI: batch raw creator-only event
    Sink-->>Web: EventBatch raw creator-only event
  else observer scope / failure
    IM-->>Sink: observer events=[]；PersistErr 不 Emit
  end
  Note over Go,IM: 到点投递由 Go 产生普通 post authority；Helix 不另建本地 schedule timer，也不把 HTTP 2xx 写成已创建终态。
